 "strings": {
  "A lady with a nicely shaped posterior who enjoys gambling at L'Amant. I'm pretty sure she has an actual name...": "",
  "A sushi chef-in-training working at Sushi Gin. Apparently he lived overseas until recently.": "",
  "A patissier working at M Side Cafe. She often asks her customers their opinions on her pastries.": "",
  "The manager of the Akaushimaru over by the Hotel District. He's pretty down-to-earth and easy to get along with.": "",
  "Also known as \"Mr. Try and Hit Me,\" his lightning-fast footwork makes him a challenge to hit.": "",
  "An employee at Smile Burger who greets every customer with a great big smile.": "",
  "A girl who works at Poppo, the local convenience store. She has a sweet smile.": "",
  "A guy who works at Poppo, the local convenience store. He always looks exhausted...": "",
  "A guy who works at Poppo, the local convenience store. I honestly don't remember much about him.": "",
  "A guy who works at Poppo, the local convenience store. I don't know where he gets all that energy from...": "",
  "A freelance journalist. Sometimes he'll ask me to round up the details on a good story.": "",
  "An employee for an IT company called G.A. Labs. He's currently in charge of constructing the company's new office.": "",
  "An employee of Quadra Garden. English is definitely not her strongest subject.": "",
  "A tailor who works at Le Marche, a luxury brand store. Can determine a person's measurements by using his eyes alone.": "",
  "A homeless man who lives in the sewers. Apparently he used to be a doctor at a medical university.": "",
  "The owner of a traditional Kyoto-style confectionery. Seems like he's had nothing but trouble ever since opening up in Kamurocho.": "",
  "The developer of a popular crowdfunding app known as Quickstarter. He's a bit too melodramatic for his own good...": "",
  "An employee of Café Mijore who has a crush on one of his coworkers.": "",
  "An employee of Café Mijore. Customers seem to appreciate her bright, positive attitude.": "",
  "A track-and-field athlete. Dude's got some serious issues, but who am I to judge?": "",
  "Owner of Ebisu Pawn. Currently on the hunt for paintings by an artist named Fuka Shiranui.": "",
  "The owner of Kamuro Lock & Key. I do some lockpicking work for him on occasion.": "",
  "Iyama: Hermit of the Dragon's Palace": "",
  "A strange old man who extracts strange medicines in the Dragon's Palace. The way he does this is remarkably similar to making stew.": "",
  "Tsukino's twin brother. Full-time student and part-time barker.": "",
  "A hostess at Apple Pie, a local cabaret club. She got a job there to pay her college tuition.": "",
  "The CEO of Turtle Financing. It seems that he goes out and collects the debts himself.": "",
  "A guy who came to Kamurocho in hopes of becoming the number one host in town. Owes a lot of money to his aunt.": "",
  "The president of Ikinari Steak. His logic on how to run a business is pretty unique for a man of his position.": "",
  "An employee of Tachibana Mahjong. You can play with the \"wareme\" ruleset there.": "",
  "A girl aiming to be a professional singer-songwriter. Young, but motivated.": "",
  "A quiet and mild-mannered girl. Her twin brother is Yosuke Saotome.": "",
  "A fortune teller who can see \"signs of calamities\" on people. Has an unusual way of speaking.": "",
  "A sophisticated woman with a professional demeanor. Sharp as a tack, too.": "",
  "Gonna bust some alien heads the minute I get home!": "",
  "That sure was an athlete chasing down some criminals just now.": "",
  "If I buy 2 hours at a soapland, can I bang for 2 hours straight?": "",
  "Maybe I should do some karaoke. I keep seeing this cute girl there.": "",
  "The Keihin Gang has no decency whatsoever.": "",
  "I want to join the Twisted Trio too! ...Wonder what it takes to get in?": "",
  "I wish I'd win the lottery. But gambling has better odds.": "",
  "Whenever Sana-chan sings, it's like she purifies my soul.": "",
  "One of my supervisors seems to love spinach. But why...?": "",
  "I had no idea Ono Michio expanded into Tokyo. How cool.": "",
  "No lie, I saw a ninja climbing up Kamuro Hills!": "",
  "All the damn couples clog up the batting cages.": "",
  "Wanna hit up the arcade? Play some Kamuro of the Dead?": "",
  "After he got jumped by those Keihin guys, he split town.": "",
  "If the Twisted Trio recruits me, I wanna be called Dr. Long Dong.": "",
  "I got a mocha at Alps, but they forgot the chocolate. Life sucks.": "",
  "That massage chick is up to no good. She ain't touching me!": "",
  "The new Ono Michio sucks ass. First one was way doper.": "",
  "Which do you like more? Beef Zone or Kanrai?": "",
  "I saw this weird couple at the batting center.": "",
  "Some bimbo came up and told me a \"calamity\" would hit me.": "",
  "The girl at M Side Cafe has the most beautiful eyes...": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>What's the deal</font_kind> with all these <font_kind=yakuza_italic>stray</font_kind> <font_kind=yakuza_italic>cats</font_kind>? I keep <font_kind=yakuza_italic>stepping</font_kind> in their <font_kind=yakuza_italic>feces</font_kind>!": "",
  "Do you think the Bantam owner is... bantamweight?": "",
  "How is the batting center still open? It's a ghost town.": "",
  "What happened to Little Asia? They had the best Chinese food.": "",
  "Wonder when Bram-sama's new single's coming out.": "",
  "It's shameful that Isetani exploits its workers.": "",
  "Actual college girls work at Apple Pie. In maid outfits!": "",
  "I read the new Edison book, and everything feels so familiar...": "",
  "What kind of anime would be popular with the elderly?": "",
  "The Bahamas sounds nice. Nothing but sun, fun, and bikini buns...": "",
  "\"Do you charge extra for a smile?\" I always ask the cashier.": "",
  "My daughter's friend was groped by a fiend called Ass Catchem.": "",
  "I saw this weirdo talking to an alley cat on Nakamichi Street.": "",
  "So you got a raise and a bonus? Then treat me to barbecue!": "",
  "Remember that guy who quit? Yeah, he got terminally ill.": "",
  "That contractor, Inamoto's the name. The man's ugly as sin.": "",
  "How can a bunch of thieves proclaim to be \"righteous\"?": "",
  "Apparently those burglars cost our client a lot.": "",
  "Ah, people fight here all the time. If only I were younger.": "",
  "I leave my old lady alone for one second...": "",
  "Gonna visit Konban Wife later tonight. Hellooooo darlin'!": "",
  "Ohhhh... Well this ain't good. Where'd my dentures go?": "",
  "The missus says I smell like lemons. That good or bad?": "",
  "My fool grandkid joined them Keihin hooligans.": "",
  "I got lost again...": "",
  "So rowdy around town lately, and the police aren't doing squat!": "",
  "I'm too scared to go in the arcade.": "",
  "Pink Street's got this old codger tickled pink! Yahoo!": "",
  "All I can muster these days is a wee little drip from the faucet.": "",
  "Darn shame nobody plays gateball nowadays...": "",
  "If you search the ground good enough, ya might find somethin'!": "",
  "Shoot. Wore my old lady's underwear by mistake!": "",
  "VR? That some sorta venereal disease?": "",
  "I heard Kimiji-san's grandkid went to a nice university.": "",
  "My grandson doesn't study at all.": "",
  "I prefer Apple Pie over Konban Wife. Got one too many wives already!": "",
  "Pop quiz! What's difference between snack bars and cabarets?": "",
  "Cabaret clubs? With sexy girls? Can I touch 'em?": "",
  "Damn! I left my eyedrops somewhere!": "",
  "What's on the menu tonight? Or, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>who's</font_kind> on the menu? Tee-hee!": "",
  "Pesky asshole... I should just tell him no.": "",
  "Shaving is a never-ending cycle!": "",
  "Can't go to the salon without a good book...": "",
  "Better let Mom know I'll be home late tonight.": "",
  "Why are the posters always so weird around here?": "",
  "I got this record from Poppo, but how am I supposed to play it?": "",
  "Know what'd be nice right about now? A full facial and body scrub.": "",
  "Poppo is always sold out of dorayaki no matter when I go...": "",
  "The desserts at M Side Cafe are the best I've ever had!": "",
  "I heard Hotel New Deborah used to be a club way back.": "",
  "Some foreigner started talking to me at Quadra Garden. Yup.": "",
  "Hey, why can't we just take a taxi?": "",
  "Can't we stop by the convenience store first?": "",
  "I heard that VR Paradise is open! It's a new VR arcade!": "",
  "Hey, how does grabbing some tea at Mijore sound?": "",
  "If you wanna take better pictures, just use a filter!": "",
  "This waiter friend of mine showed me a secret menu!": "",
  "Oooh, could you get me a Koro-nyan from the UFO Catcher!?": "",
  "Oh no, my key broke... Better call the locksmith.": "",
  "I need to hurry home and prepare dinner.": "",
  "Convenience store bentos aren't so bad, huh?": "",
  "What time did he say he was coming home?": "",
  "*sigh* Maybe I should ask for more shifts...": "",
  "He said he'll be home once he's done drinking... the bastard.": "",
  "They put in a smoking area for a reason. Use it!": "",
  "Oh? I thought it was around here...": "",
  "Is my daughter studying hard? Or hardly studying?": "",
  "My son's cram school tuition is double my entire paycheck.": "",
  "How about we go to Alps for some coffee?": "",
  "Is it true that refrigerated onions make you cry less?": "",
  "If you drop a raw egg, pour salt on it to make it easier to clean up.": "",
  "Rub vegetables with aluminum foil for easy peeling.": "",
  "A dollop of soy sauce on rice makes it stick less in the pot.": "",
  "A plastic bottle cap is equal to roughly two teaspoons.": "",
  "Rub vinegar inside your garbage can to keep the smell away.": "",
  "Clean the house with a mop soaked in herbal oils to prevent roaches.": "",
  "Put chopsticks on the lid of a boiling pot to prevent overflow.": "",
  "Wiping with a shampooed rag is the best way to remove dust.": "",
  "This town certainly has changed over the years.": "",
  "I wonder if this's the place my granddaughter talks about.": "",
  "I'd have made a much more sultry cabaret girl than these floozies.": "",
  "I'd sure like to fly me a drone sometime.": "",
  "When will the construction at Little Asia be done?": "",
  "Kids nowadays never look up from their phones...": "",
  "I'd rather hear their voice than read messages all the time.": "",
  "The coffee over at Alps is just how I like it.": "",
  "Now what should I get my grandson today?": "",
  "Where was the taxi stand again...?": "",
  "Time passes by much quicker when you're old and gray.": "",
  "My husband did see the doctor, but then...": "",
  "These old eyes of mine can't even read these signboards...": "",
  "Apparently phones nowadays can \"go viral.\" Should I see a doctor?": "",
  "I wish my son would find himself someone nice.": "",
  "My grandkids always ask me when our house is gonna get \"Wife Eye.\"": "",
  "I do enjoy the occasional stroll around town.": "",
  "Must be fashionable to take pictures of what you eat.": "",
  "My son's getting married, but the ceremony is overseas...": "",
  "That daughter-in-law of mine cannot cook worth a damn.": "",
  "Tashima practically rushed out the door to hit that soapland.": "",
  "I saw Mr. Try and Hit Me buying a porno magazine.": "",
  "Some bum over at Earth Angel kept pestering me to drink.": "",
  "They say this famous author likes to drink in the Champion District.": "",
  "Wild Jackson's manager came up to me and started blubbering...": "",
  "Boy, that barker sure loves talkin' 'bout tits. Too bad I'm an ass man.": "",
  "There's no way it's only 2 grand. What was up with that old fart?": "",
  "I've always wanted a degenerate mess of a girlfriend.": "",
  "I should sell this ring I got my bitch of an ex at Ebisu.": "",
  "That group date was a total bust. Those hags were older than time.": "",
  "Michiko went home with Sakai, right? Right after Kitamura boned her, too.": "",
  "Matchmaking in Kamurocho? Here come the scammers.": "",
  "Nothing new ever happens. It's all the same shit.": "",
  "I can't wait to play Kamuro of the Dead!": "",
  "So the event planner from Wette Kitchen comes up to me, and...": "",
  "Isn't Alps holding a coffee tasting event or something?": "",
  "Heard Kanrai has a special kalbi, but I have yet to see it.": "",
  "My buddy was about to get arrested when this athlete started chasing him.": "",
  "Didn't our boss learn anything from our harassment training?": "",
  "Did I mention I was drunk enough to drink my dad's denture water?": "",
  "Been having difficulty peeing lately. That's normal, right?": "",
  "I'm in the doghouse till payday. Spent too much on games.": "",
  "I declare that tonight is family night! To hell with overtime!": "",
  "My daughter hasn't looked at or spoken to me in over 6 months...": "",
  "\"Business trip\" here I come! Gonna hit up every sexy soapland in town!": "",
  "I'm gonna eat curry back at the house and nobody's gonna stop me!": "",
  "Time to unwind with some Kamuro of the Dead.": "",
  "Well... I guess I'm finishing the night at Kyushu No. 1 Star.": "",
  "Haven't drank this much in a while. Damn fun party, though.": "",
  "Talking to our new employees gives me life!": "",
  "Our new secretary doesn't even know how to answer the phone.": "",
  "The chief keeps calling the new girl into his office... <font_kind=yakuza_italic>alone</font_kind>.": "",
  "Ugh... I ate too much... I think I'm gonna barf.": "",
  "I always see hosts at Kanrai. Lucky, loaded bastards...": "",
  "We head home the same way. Want to just take a cab?": "",
  "Doing sales at this age is the pits! Wish I had a desk job...": "",
  "The girls I met at the group date were 20 years too young.": "",
  "Hanada's been going to shady seminars that cost a lot of money.": "",
  "My daughter got a job offer from Isetani Trading Company.": "",
  "Valhalla Land is out? Okay then, bring on the valkyries!": "",
  "A nice young man in a ninja suit helped me cross the road.": "",
  "She looks a lot like the missus, back when she was young and pretty.": "",
  "Back in my day, I could eat a five-pound steak in no time flat!": "",
  "A nice man named Saito said he'd help my daughter become a star!": "",
  "I wonder if Chiemi-chan from Konban Wife still has nice legs.": "",
  "Urgh. Gosh darn heartburn. Can't even slurp ramen no more.": "",
  "Tokyo's full of beautiful women. I love it here!": "",
  "My son said his apartment was around here, but I see nothing!": "",
  "Home is where the heart is... Even if it's an internet café!": "",
  "Do you remember, Sachiko? The days we spent sightseeing...?": "",
  "Got me an early bird discount at the soapland. She sure did catch the worm!": "",
  "My son says I need hearing aids, but I can hear just fine, thanks!": "",
  "My son-in-law's a good-for-nothing sheister!": "",
  "The kid in the tracksuit and glasses? Yep, he's a yakuza.": "",
  "Started doing squats so my lower legs don't cramp up.": "",
  "Has it really been 60 years? Everything's so different...": "",
  "She divorced you? Is it because of your affair with that student?": "",
  "You don't know the secret to getting in the gambling house?": "",
  "There's something real fishy going on at Koi Bride... Heheh.": "",
  "Hope I don't get found dead with my eyes missing. So scary.": "",
  "I <font_kind=yakuza_italic>so</font_kind> do not want to go to the company drinking party.": "",
  "Gosh, it's late! I really should get to bed.": "",
  "Maybe I'll watch a movie before going home...": "",
  "...Did I lock my door before leaving the house?": "",
  "God, my boss is such a creep.": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Everyone</font_kind> has a boyfriend but me. Why? Why am I the only one single?": "",
  "I think I'd work better at night than during the day.": "",
  "That guy was a complete scumbag. See, this is why I hate walking here.": "",
  "Theater Square is the place to be at night!": "",
  "I just love the Drone League receptionist's outfit. So cute.": "",
  "Huh? A boyfriend? ...Well, I guess you could call him that.": "",
  "My man's taking me to Hawaii!": "",
  "He took me to a dirty old fishing pond on our first date. Ugh...": "",
  "Nothing like a good arcade! It's zombie-shootin' time!": "",
  "I found tickets for Bram-sama online!": "",
  "Don't stray cats bring good luck? Or is it the other way around...?": "",
  "He said he learned a new \"skill\" after reading this strange book.": "",
  "The updated version actually navigates you the whole way.": "",
  "KamuroGo's nice for the coupons, but where are the little creatures?": "",
  "One more Koro-nyan plush to go!": "",
  "I managed the baseball team back in high school... Good times...": "",
  "If I can't drink with a stud, might as well take my husband.": "",
  "Could you take it to a meeting room? Some of us are working.": "",
  "I'm a cougar on the prowl, looking for my next prey...": "",
  "I used to drink until morning, no problem!": "",
  "Being around the younger gals at the office makes me feel old.": "",
  "It's nice that Kamurocho has so many late-night options.": "",
  "The chief wants to drink all night... Here we go again...": "",
  "I know I said I'd quit going to Stardust, yet here I am again...": "",
  "You don't mind an older lady like me? ...I wish I could say that to a man.": "",
  "Everyone, prepare your livers! We're drinking till the sun rises!": "",
  "My son brought a girl home for the first time in years.": "",
  "Absolutely not! <font_kind=yakuza_italic>I'll</font_kind> be paying the check today, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>thank you very much</font_kind>!": "",
  "When I saw what my daughter calls booty shorts, I was appalled.": "",
  "I'm at the age where I've started to grunt whenever I stand up...": "",
  "My son refers to all my favorite songs as oldies.": ""
 },
